# Check every text file out with LF line endings, on every platform.
#
# Skill bodies have byte budgets, the MCP bundle is compared byte for byte with
# a fresh build, and clients parse frontmatter, so a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows default) used to fail three verify
# gates and inflate every skill. Git detects binary files itself; the lines
# below only pin types it could guess wrong.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.epub binary
*.zip  binary
*.tgz  binary
*.gz   binary
